      "worked": "Since $P$ is even, $P(-x)=P(x)$ for every real $x$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(-x)&=a(-x)^2+b(-x)+c\\\\P(-x)&=ax^2-bx+c.\\end{align*}$$\n\nComparing coefficients of $x$ gives $-b=b$, so $b=0$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
